{"unit_id":"lsdt45__dsh-plan-plus#card-zh","repo":"lsdt45/dsh-plan-plus","commit":"faa865dba45e477cfb77621a6ffeb3a75d577baa","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plan-plus 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 的计划评审增强插件。它接入会话评审卡、输入行和外层浮层，让用户在评审计划时直接提交修改意见，并在模型修订后查看与上一版的行级差异。用户还可以从输入行打开计划查看器，切换历史版本、阅读完整 Markdown 内容、对比相邻版本，或编辑计划正文并保存为浏览器中的本地版本。展开视图可在会话区域阅读计划。适合需要反复审阅和整理 DSH 计划的 Web 用户；无需额外 API key 或外部账号，编辑副本写入浏览器 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:575-707","client.js:722-769","client.js:795-894","client.js:915-1018"]}
{"unit_id":"lsdt45__dsh-plan-plus#card-en","repo":"lsdt45/dsh-plan-plus","commit":"faa865dba45e477cfb77621a6ffeb3a75d577baa","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plan-plus improves plan review in DSH Web. Users can send revision feedback, browse plan versions, compare changes line by line, and edit a plan as a browser-local copy. A viewer displays Markdown and can expand across the conversation. No extra API key or account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:575-707","client.js:722-769","client.js:795-894","client.js:915-1018"]}
